{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Cozy Bookshop</strong> is a charming blend of <strong>shop management sim</strong> and <strong>light RPG</strong>, set in a colorful fantasy world full of magical readers, curious wanderers, and mysterious tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your grandma decides to retire to a tropical island to finally finish writing her book, she hands the family bookshop over to you\u2014<strong>with no room for negotiation</strong>. The only thing you <i>do</i> get a say in? <strong>Renaming the place and making it your own.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Run Your Own Bookshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shelves, decorate the shop and help a variety of <strong>quirky customers</strong> find their next favorite read\u2014whether it\u2019s a <strong>wizard in need of spellbooks</strong>, a <strong>hopeless romantic</strong>, or a humble reader just looking to unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884660/extras/e9ee7b7c0d7057a01ddb8cef89901a8d.poster.avif?t=1770360885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884660/extras/e9ee7b7c0d7057a01ddb8cef89901a8d.webm?t=1770360885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884660/extras/e9ee7b7c0d7057a01ddb8cef89901a8d.mp4?t=1770360885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Explore and Collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step outside the shop and explore a vibrant, stylized world. <strong>Forage for rare books</strong> hidden in forgotten ruins or quiet forests, <strong>gather herbs and flowers</strong>, and bring your finds back to enhance your shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea\u00a0<strong>Grow and Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant herbs for potion crafting, decorate your space with cozy touches, and <strong>upgrade the shop</strong> to unlock <strong>new spells, recipes, regions, and storylines</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and grow your own magical bookshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell to unique, fantasy-inspired customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for rare books and resources in the wild</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions and decorate with herbal plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop and unlock magical upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rename the store and make it your own!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884660?t=1770360885","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884660?t=1770360885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884660/2963ccc4e36be5de9db31955ac37c4c2f3132833/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770360885","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884660/2963ccc4e36be5de9db31955ac37c4c2f3132833/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770360885","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4389830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Cozy Bookshop</strong> is a charming blend of <strong>shop management sim</strong> and <strong>light RPG</strong>, set in a colorful fantasy world full of magical readers, curious wanderers, and mysterious tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your grandma decides to retire to a tropical island to finally finish writing her book, she hands the family bookshop over to you\u2014<strong>with no room for negotiation</strong>. The only thing you <i>do</i> get a say in? <strong>Renaming the place and making it your own.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Run Your Own Bookshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shelves, decorate the shop and help a variety of <strong>quirky customers</strong> find their next favorite read\u2014whether it\u2019s a <strong>wizard in need of spellbooks</strong>, a <strong>hopeless romantic</strong>, or a humble reader just looking to unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884660/extras/e9ee7b7c0d7057a01ddb8cef89901a8d.poster.avif?t=1770360885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884660/extras/e9ee7b7c0d7057a01ddb8cef89901a8d.webm?t=1770360885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884660/extras/e9ee7b7c0d7057a01ddb8cef89901a8d.mp4?t=1770360885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Explore and Collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step outside the shop and explore a vibrant, stylized world. <strong>Forage for rare books</strong> hidden in forgotten ruins or quiet forests, <strong>gather herbs and flowers</strong>, and bring your finds back to enhance your shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea\u00a0<strong>Grow and Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant herbs for potion crafting, decorate your space with cozy touches, and <strong>upgrade the shop</strong> to unlock <strong>new spells, recipes, regions, and storylines</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and grow your own magical bookshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell to unique, fantasy-inspired customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for rare books and resources in the wild</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions and decorate with herbal plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop and unlock magical upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rename the store and make it your own!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["GlitchStep Gamez"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884660/f33808e65aa16b14291615482a042e82d5dc09ee/header.jpg?t=1770360885","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884660/739791584/e183e0119a2d85bba56a0043eee3bbbc96e7ca10/1764220518/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764220949","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884660/739791584/e183e0119a2d85bba56a0043eee3bbbc96e7ca10/1764220518/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764220949","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884660/739791584/e183e0119a2d85bba56a0043eee3bbbc96e7ca10/1764220518/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764220949","id":257239093,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257239093/6ab1f977aecbbd2d9f64e1bae40439a8b938ed47/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764220949"}],"name":"My Cozy BookShop","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 